{
  "_comment": [
    "The current REC Exam Browser build, per platform (Phase 14f).",
    "Copy to public/latest.json and edit. Served at",
    "/downloads/exam-browser/latest.json with Cache-Control: no-store.",
    "",
    "This says what is CURRENT. What is REFUSED is the version floor, set",
    "on /super/settings/integrations, and the two are deliberately",
    "separate: publishing a build inconveniences nobody, while raising the",
    "floor refuses every candidate on an older copy from their next",
    "request onwards. See README.md.",
    "",
    "sha256 is here so a candidate or an invigilator can check a download",
    "against something the college published, independently of the",
    "signature on the installer. Produce it with:",
    "  sha256sum REC-Exam-Browser-1.0.0-win-x64.exe"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "releasedAt": "2026-11-05",
  "notes": "First release. docs/EXAM-BROWSER.md describes what it does and what it cannot do.",
